            "review_title": "Review at Clará Cuban Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Cameron T\nHanoi, Vietnam25 contributions\n0\nDrinks are good…that’s about it\nJul 2023 • Couples\nWent tonight with high expectations to get a taste of Latin America but was left with the flat flavors of their signature dishes. The garlic shrimp was obviously cooked with garlic bits and oil but all flavor was fleeting. Thankfully the garlic sauce which came with the tostones provided some sort of flavor. The ropa viejo was quite average. \n\nNothing tonight reminded me of the Americas, except the drinks. The Hemingway cocktail was wonderful.\nRead more\nWritten July 26, 2023",
